@rem Your ModelVault settings. Lines here override the defaults. Remove "@rem " at the start of a line to use it,
@rem save this file, then stop and start ModelVault again (Start menu: Stop ModelVault, then ModelVault).
@rem Library and Downloads folders are easier to change in ModelVault: Settings > Import existing library.

@rem More folders to browse and import from: name=path, separated by commas.
@rem set "EXTRA_DIRS=newmodels=%USERPROFILE%\Downloads\Models,archive=D:\Old models"

@rem The web address port: http://localhost:8420
@rem set "PORT=8420"

@rem Optional login prompt (useful if other people on your network can reach this PC).
@rem set "APP_USER=admin"
@rem set "APP_PASSWORD=choose-a-password"

@rem Open the browser when ModelVault starts: 1 = yes, 0 = no.
@rem set "OPEN_BROWSER=1"
